            ]
          },
          "text": "We’d like to thank @AnthropicAI for exposing these instances of AI abuse. We’d also like to share our own experiences.\nSince 2022, we have received submissions from people across China and published their stories on X—including news and firsthand accounts that would otherwise be censored or suppressed within China. This work has made us one of the most influential Chinese-language news accounts on X, as well as a vital channel for the Chinese people to bypass domestic censorship and make their voices heard abroad.\nIn addition, we have been subjected to persistent and organized harassment by bot networks linked to China. Some accounts mimic our past reports, fabricate submissions, and send them to us on a massive scale. Currently, we receive hundreds of harassing direct messages every day, including a large number of false leads that appear to be generated by artificial intelligence.\nThese attacks increase the burden of verifying submissions and make it harder for genuine reports and urgent appeals for help to be heard.\nWe look forward to collaborating with @AnthropicAI and X @benjitaylor  to jointly investigate and address these actions, while protecting the identities and privacy of our real sources. \nhttps://t.co/2qTpjo4gsG"
        },
